Description: Use Debian normaliz package instead of normaliz shipped with M2.
 Also backport change from upstream to work with normaliz 3.0+.
Author: Doug Torrance <dtorrance@piedmont.edu>
Origin: https://github.com/Normaliz/Normaliz/commit/22fab00
Last-Update: 2016-04-11

